    <description>FB-V1 benchmark SF01 — the subflow called by FL12. Closes out an order's fulfilment work: fetch the order's open tasks, iterate them, mark each Completed, and write the whole set back in one update. If the write-back fails, the failure is recorded as a CloseoutFault audit-log entry instead of propagating (fault connector on the DML).</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <interviewLabel>PLS FB SF01 Close Tasks {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>PLS FB SF01 Close Tasks</label>
    <loops>
